01
Two sides.
One simple queue.

Bob starts a market, sets the odds and puts money on YES. Alice and Cecile can add to YES. NO bets match Bob first, then Alice, then Cecile. Every new backing deposit joins the back.

Try it below: Bob adds 50 USDC, Alice 30, Cecile 20. At 50% odds, 40 USDC on NO matches only Bob. These are example prices, not measured chances of winning.

